  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Technomancy sphere, Tinker sphere (at least one (gizmo) talent).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You treat any of your gizmos that contain any of your sprites as if they are always within signal range. When you move a sprite to a new host, you may move a routine you have crafted from the old host into the new host alongside the sprite.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
